{"id":"661757","name":"辣炒鸡胗酸豆角","author":"双鱼座的美食","authorId":"11350065","desc":"","cover":"images/661757/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸡胗子","amount":"250g"}],"sub":[{"name":"酸豆角","amount":"1把"},{"name":"青蒜苗","amount":"1颗"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"鸡胗子洗净焯水切片。","img":"images/661757/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"酸豆角切末。","img":"images/661757/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"葱，姜，蒜，小米辣，切末。","img":"images/661757/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"青蒜苗切段。","img":"images/661757/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"姜，蒜，小米辣，爆锅后放入鸡胗翻炒。","img":"images/661757/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入生抽，蚝油，花椒粉，一点点盐调味。","img":"images/661757/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"入葱花。","img":"images/661757/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"酸豆角。","img":"images/661757/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"青蒜苗配色。","img":"images/661757/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"翻炒均匀。","img":"images/661757/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"上桌。","img":"images/661757/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"如果豆角咸就不要加盐了。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}